# Explicit build-context allowlist: exclude local databases, CAD tools, EDI
# files, credentials, and unrelated untracked material.
*
!src/
!src/**
!modules/
!modules/**
!integration/
!integration/**
!industrial/
!industrial/**
!web/
!web/**
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.json
!src/CoroMES.Api/appsettings.json
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
